    <briefdescription>
<para>Iterator for locations and the values they contain. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Dereferencing produces a struct/pair containing the <ref refid="class_live_debug_values_1_1_loc_idx" kindref="compound">LocIdx</ref> key for this location, and a reference to the value currently stored. Simplifies the process of seeking a particular location. </para>
